WEBVTT

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:10.098
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:19.843
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:29.658
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:39.065
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:49.609
<i>... I look back, and
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:56.578
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.191
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:06.026
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.693
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:18.868
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.991
Yatchan, wait!

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:43.735
What's wrong with him?

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:46.039
He wants to hurry over the mountain.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.301
<i>That's impossible!
He wants to hurry over the mountain.</i>

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.807
No one told me there was
going to be a blizzard!

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.069
Deal with it!

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.611
There's a cabin up ahead!

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.779
What's his problem?
Who does he think he is?

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:03.583
He's the only one
who knows this mountain.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.063
<i>Episode 9
When The Wind Flowers Dance</i>

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:23.375
Keep walking, everyone!

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:27.706
There's a cabin up ahead!
Hang in there just a little longer.

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:31.510
Don't give up here,
before we make it to Tento!

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.815
Hang in there, Tiger!

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:40.425
Shut up! I am hanging in there.

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:41.926
Fine then...

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:44.461
But hang in there.

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.598
Hang in there...

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.934
Hang in...

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:02.070
Yatchan, is it okay? I'm sorry...

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:02.909
Sure.

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:07.081
I'm going to take a bath... sorry...

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:07.845
Sure.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:14.022
She said, "We're going to take a bath".

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.889
Oh. Ahh...

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:28.363
Yajiro's been acting strange.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:32.107
One minute he's irritable,
then he's out of it...

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:34.908
I think he has a lot of memories.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:35.470
Huh?

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:40.285
He said he lost a lot of friends
on this mountain a long time ago.

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:44.316
I'm sure that still
weighs heavily on his heart.

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.488
Touka told me...

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:48.485
Huh?

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:52.327
...that he probably already knows.

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.999
What do you mean?

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:57.625
He's seen a lot of the things that
you and Touka are trying to change.

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:04.636
A man like you...

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:06.606
A man like you...

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:11.977
...it's a waste to hate him.

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:21.056
Hang in there, King...

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:22.627
Hang in there.

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:24.487
I will too.

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.899
It's over now.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.426
Teppa.

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:35.971
And he understands what
Tenshi is trying to accomplish.

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:39.204
He understands Tenshi?

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.170
Yeah, but...

00:04:42.315 --> 00:04:45.045
...all the friends he lost to war...

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:48.454
...is the reason why he can't let go.

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.725
N-No way...

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:00.732
You're alive!

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.202
Fuuka!

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:15.645
Fuuka!

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:26.250
Hang on!

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.192
Hang on!

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:32.020
Tiger... no, you'll fall too.

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:36.463
No, we promised to go
to the capital together.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:42.563
Carry on my will.

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:46.568
Fuuka!

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:09.358
Yatchan, do you want to
use the rest of the water?

00:06:09.469 --> 00:06:11.232
It will warm you up.

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:14.363
Yajiro, get in!

00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:15.668
Oh?

00:06:17.343 --> 00:06:18.401
He's gone.

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:19.272
Huh?

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:23.173
I wonder if he went ahead by himself.

00:06:23.416 --> 00:06:24.781
He wouldn't.

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:27.216
Knowing him, I wouldn't put it past him.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.288
I don't think so.

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:31.615
I'll go take a look.

00:06:31.758 --> 00:06:35.387
But your clothes aren't dry at all.

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:38.686
No problem.

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:46.435
This is pretty warm.

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:47.402
Wow.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.804
Isn't it great?

00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:51.274
Yeah, it is.

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:53.811
Here, you can have one too.

00:06:54.347 --> 00:06:56.372
This one's mine?

00:06:56.649 --> 00:06:58.117
Don't catch a chill!

00:06:58.117 --> 00:06:58.981
<i>Okay!
Don't catch a chill!</i>

00:07:05.858 --> 00:07:08.156
I think it suits me.

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.660
<i>Are you serious?</i>

00:07:09.762 --> 00:07:12.959
Bunny, bunny, bunny.
Shake, shake, shake, shake.

00:07:13.065 --> 00:07:14.430
Hop, hop, hop.

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:16.764
Shake, shake, shake, shake. Yay!

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:19.662
Something's coming.

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:20.967
Uh-oh...

00:07:21.474 --> 00:07:22.304
I can't...

00:07:23.176 --> 00:07:24.006
Huh?

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:25.644
I can't reach.

00:07:38.524 --> 00:07:39.821
W-What!

00:07:43.496 --> 00:07:45.589
This attack... it can't be.

00:07:50.369 --> 00:07:53.702
Hey, Yajiro!

00:07:56.876 --> 00:07:58.036
Yajiro!

00:07:58.277 --> 00:08:00.837
Oh no, he's frozen.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:08.611
Don't get the wrong idea.
I'm just warming you up.

00:08:12.258 --> 00:08:15.591
Is it... real?

00:08:16.896 --> 00:08:21.560
I wish they were real,
but mine aren't this big yet.

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:23.635
<i>I didn't mean your breasts!</i>

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.200
You're alive, Fuuka!

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:27.806
Snap out of it.

00:08:27.907 --> 00:08:29.465
Who's Fuuka?

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.040
What are you wearing?

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:34.112
You...

00:08:36.916 --> 00:08:39.646
Your wound opened back up.

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.591
This is bad.

00:08:48.227 --> 00:08:49.455
Um...

00:08:50.096 --> 00:08:52.894
Why are you after me?

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:58.231
Rushuna Tendo, now you
want to know the reason?

00:08:58.471 --> 00:08:59.460
A woman?

00:09:00.072 --> 00:09:05.408
I come in the place of Souma, who you
killed. I am one of the Juttensen...

00:09:06.412 --> 00:09:09.347
...Fuuka Shirato, that is my name.

00:09:09.448 --> 00:09:11.712
Souma? You got it wrong!

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:13.375
I didn't kill him.

00:09:13.486 --> 00:09:16.148
Stop pretending you don't know.
There you are!

00:09:21.994 --> 00:09:25.020
I've seen that gun before.

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:31.133
This power is called Enlightened Evil.

00:09:32.939 --> 00:09:36.136
Enlightened Evil, isn't it?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.808
And, so what if it is?

00:09:43.883 --> 00:09:45.748
Prepare yourself.

00:09:56.395 --> 00:09:57.828
Senshi skill...

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.930
...Enchanting Snow Dance!

00:10:07.173 --> 00:10:09.073
I can't see!

00:10:11.177 --> 00:10:13.509
I can't see her shots.

00:10:14.146 --> 00:10:16.376
Wait, it's only for an instant...

00:10:16.515 --> 00:10:17.914
If I look at the movement of the snow...

00:10:18.017 --> 00:10:20.781
...I can tell which direction
the shots are coming from.

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:24.946
Fuuka isn't that strong.

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:26.820
So why is she...

00:10:28.327 --> 00:10:30.192
Enlightenment... that's it!

00:10:30.396 --> 00:10:33.627
What are you looking at?
Is this that easy for you?

00:10:40.172 --> 00:10:41.400
Thank you.

00:10:41.607 --> 00:10:43.575
It's much easier to move around now.

00:10:43.676 --> 00:10:45.405
Stop messing around!

00:10:49.181 --> 00:10:50.978
Where is he?

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:52.072
Who?

00:10:52.218 --> 00:10:56.018
If your weapon is the Enlightened Evil,
the Jester should be here somewhere.

00:10:56.122 --> 00:10:56.952
What?

00:10:58.124 --> 00:11:03.084
The Jester is the bad guy. You don't
seem like you're that kind of person.

00:11:03.195 --> 00:11:04.321
You!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.954
Stop it!

00:11:06.499 --> 00:11:07.523
Yatchan!

00:11:09.402 --> 00:11:10.426
Tiger...

00:11:12.271 --> 00:11:16.605
There is only one person
who calls me that... Fuuka.

00:11:19.278 --> 00:11:22.611
Don't worry about it.
You didn't do this.

00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:23.913
Yatchan!

00:11:24.016 --> 00:11:25.108
Ouch.

00:11:25.685 --> 00:11:27.653
Do you know her?

00:11:27.853 --> 00:11:32.313
She's one of my mates I thought was
dead. I had no idea she was alive.

00:11:32.425 --> 00:11:34.916
Thank god I didn't fight her.

00:11:35.061 --> 00:11:38.758
She's not alive.
She's being allowed to live.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:45.596
The Enlightened Evil is
barely keeping her alive.

00:11:46.405 --> 00:11:51.001
Yes, that woman was one step from
death.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:01.818
Her last flicker of life...

00:12:02.555 --> 00:12:08.494
By uniting it with the Enlightened Evil,
she was able to cling to her life.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:20.539
And in this last year and a half, the
Enlightened Evil became Fuuka herself.

00:12:23.209 --> 00:12:26.178
If the Enlightened Evil
is removed from her...

00:12:26.278 --> 00:12:29.441
...Fuuka's life will come to an end.

00:12:29.882 --> 00:12:30.906
But...

00:12:31.117 --> 00:12:33.984
What the hell have you done!
You dirty bastard!

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:35.383
Dirty?

00:12:35.488 --> 00:12:37.854
I saved her life.

00:12:38.023 --> 00:12:39.217
Yajiro!

00:12:40.226 --> 00:12:45.220
This woman, Shirato Fuuka,
or Rushuna Tendo...

00:12:46.132 --> 00:12:48.930
Only one of them may live.

00:12:49.735 --> 00:12:52.829
Which one will you choose?

00:12:54.974 --> 00:12:56.771
Give me a break!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.611
Fuuka, why are you trying to kill
Rushuna?

00:13:00.713 --> 00:13:03.011
Why have you sided with Tenshi?

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:05.276
Is it because they saved your life?

00:13:05.384 --> 00:13:06.248
No.

00:13:06.952 --> 00:13:11.116
Tenshi isn't the kind of person
we thought she was.

00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:14.419
She had it all thought out.

00:13:16.228 --> 00:13:20.358
I hear you put your life
in danger to meet me.

00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:23.958
But your life was spared.

00:13:24.403 --> 00:13:27.531
Treasure that life.

00:13:29.341 --> 00:13:31.366
We... you...

00:13:31.477 --> 00:13:32.774
I know.

00:13:33.412 --> 00:13:37.610
I am pleased that you are trying to
put an end to these times of war.

00:13:37.883 --> 00:13:40.852
I was waiting for the time...

00:13:41.086 --> 00:13:45.045
...when the truly strong Senshi
would come together.

00:13:46.292 --> 00:13:52.322
If those with power have no one
to exert their power over...

00:13:52.531 --> 00:13:55.762
...this feuding will not end.

00:13:57.069 --> 00:14:00.300
You have acquired a great weapon.

00:14:00.406 --> 00:14:05.105
Become stronger and stronger for me.

00:14:07.646 --> 00:14:13.778
She is trying to make our dreams
of world unity come true.

00:14:14.053 --> 00:14:18.717
Those with power are given domains to
rule so the fighting will come to an end.

00:14:19.491 --> 00:14:20.685
What?

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:25.554
Tiger, this is what we dreamed about.

00:14:28.267 --> 00:14:31.862
That's not true!
Tenshi would never say that!

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:33.698
You have no right to argue!

00:14:33.806 --> 00:14:37.333
You have acted against
the doctrine of Tenshi.

00:14:37.543 --> 00:14:40.603
Rushuna Tendo, you are a
member of the rebellion!

00:14:42.181 --> 00:14:44.547
Please let me talk to Tenshi!

00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:51.015
No, I can't shoot her.

00:14:51.123 --> 00:14:55.389
That's right, you can't kill Fuuka.

00:14:55.594 --> 00:14:59.223
You cannot strip her of her armor.

00:15:00.065 --> 00:15:02.033
You bastard!

00:15:04.403 --> 00:15:06.769
You've been a thorn in our side.

00:15:06.872 --> 00:15:08.840
But this is the end.

00:15:09.008 --> 00:15:12.603
Farewell, Rushuna Tendo.

00:15:13.979 --> 00:15:14.638
No!

00:15:15.214 --> 00:15:16.738
What are you doing?

00:15:16.849 --> 00:15:18.248
Listen to me!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:22.047
That's not how Rushuna is.
She hasn't done anything wrong!

00:15:22.154 --> 00:15:23.280
Yatchan!

00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:24.920
Let go!

00:15:25.024 --> 00:15:27.549
Don't you believe me?

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:29.757
Tiger...

00:15:35.834 --> 00:15:36.960
Rushuna!

00:15:56.488 --> 00:16:00.219
Don't give up here,
before we make it to Tento!

00:16:04.063 --> 00:16:05.428
You're...

00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:07.197
What is this?

00:16:09.735 --> 00:16:11.202
Everyone, run!

00:16:13.138 --> 00:16:14.036
Yatchan!

00:16:24.049 --> 00:16:25.209
Vanished...

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.684
Rushuna!

00:16:28.821 --> 00:16:30.880
He ran away.

00:16:31.156 --> 00:16:32.783
Where are they?

00:16:32.891 --> 00:16:33.755
That's right!

00:16:36.895 --> 00:16:38.590
Hey, Fuuka.

00:16:44.803 --> 00:16:46.168
Are you okay?

00:16:46.271 --> 00:16:47.568
Take it easy.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.134
Tiger...

00:16:52.978 --> 00:16:54.536
Where am I?

00:16:54.813 --> 00:16:56.110
I see...

00:17:03.922 --> 00:17:05.651
Are you hurt?

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:09.157
I'm okay.

00:17:09.261 --> 00:17:10.193
I see.

00:17:10.295 --> 00:17:12.024
What about that wound?

00:17:12.131 --> 00:17:14.929
This is an old wound.
You didn't do this.

00:17:16.402 --> 00:17:17.300
Tiger...

00:17:22.041 --> 00:17:22.973
Yajiro!

00:17:23.509 --> 00:17:25.204
Kaizan Doshi!

00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:29.109
You, who chose the way of the sword...

00:17:29.214 --> 00:17:31.774
When did you acquire such power?

00:17:32.251 --> 00:17:35.015
The way of the sword is of the past.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.452
Everything is for a united world.

00:17:37.623 --> 00:17:41.286
When you led us to invade
the capitol... Doshi, you...

00:17:41.727 --> 00:17:46.130
You led us swordsmen... why did you
try to bring us over this mountain?

00:17:46.298 --> 00:17:51.964
Partly to get Tenshi to
listen to what the rebels had to say.

00:17:52.571 --> 00:17:55.904
But what I was
really looking for was...

00:17:56.208 --> 00:17:57.937
...a strong life.

00:17:58.777 --> 00:17:59.641
Life?

00:18:00.279 --> 00:18:03.077
Someone who had a stronger
will to live than anyone else.

00:18:03.182 --> 00:18:05.650
Someone with the strength to live.

00:18:05.818 --> 00:18:08.548
Those who have chosen...

00:18:08.687 --> 00:18:12.953
...to live by the way of the sword are
stronger than those who use firearms.

00:18:13.058 --> 00:18:16.892
You were looking for someone who
could control the Enlightened Evil.

00:18:17.029 --> 00:18:19.463
You used Fuuka's life!

00:18:21.033 --> 00:18:24.332
World unity was your dream as well.

00:18:24.436 --> 00:18:28.736
And now, it's about to come true.
Who cares how it happens?

00:18:29.041 --> 00:18:31.475
Yajiro, become my ally again!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.636
You and I will rule the world!

00:18:37.549 --> 00:18:41.713
The Doshi that I knew wasn't the
kind of person who would use...

00:18:41.854 --> 00:18:44.982
...his friends to make
his dreams come true.

00:18:45.858 --> 00:18:48.827
You've changed, haven't you?

00:18:49.361 --> 00:18:52.922
But I too have changed!

00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:58.360
I don't like using force
to take control anymore.

00:18:59.605 --> 00:19:03.132
I see, that woman has
taken the fight out of you.

00:19:03.242 --> 00:19:04.038
No.

00:19:04.243 --> 00:19:07.110
Rushuna has proven a few things to me.

00:19:07.279 --> 00:19:09.770
She hasn't done anything wrong!

00:19:09.948 --> 00:19:13.042
Times will change! Times are changing.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.317
How unfortunate, Yajiro!

00:19:22.394 --> 00:19:23.622
Tiger, get down!

00:19:36.341 --> 00:19:40.539
In the end, they are weaklings
governed by their emotions.

00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:55.627
It's all right, Tiger. It's okay.

00:19:55.761 --> 00:19:56.625
You...

00:19:57.062 --> 00:20:01.328
I was just a pawn.

00:20:04.469 --> 00:20:05.493
Tiger...

00:20:05.671 --> 00:20:06.569
What?

00:20:10.842 --> 00:20:14.903
I want to believe what you say, Yajiro.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.542
Yatchan!

00:20:16.648 --> 00:20:17.342
There!

00:20:21.486 --> 00:20:22.418
Fuuka.

00:20:23.255 --> 00:20:27.385
Keep doing what you're doing
to make our dreams come true.

00:20:28.627 --> 00:20:29.889
Hang in there.

00:20:31.663 --> 00:20:32.789
I am.

00:20:34.099 --> 00:20:36.067
Hang on harder.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:40.837
We've done this before, haven't we?

00:20:40.939 --> 00:20:43.169
Maybe it's fate.

00:20:43.375 --> 00:20:46.776
Shut up! Don't give up!
You're coming with us!

00:20:52.317 --> 00:20:56.083
Fuuka!

00:21:23.882 --> 00:21:26.214
Is that Tento?

00:21:26.985 --> 00:21:27.747
Yes.

00:21:33.925 --> 00:21:36.917
Yatchan, how's your wound?

00:21:37.162 --> 00:21:39.528
It's fine.

00:21:42.701 --> 00:21:45.329
It's snowing again.

00:21:45.971 --> 00:21:48.337
But the sun is out.

00:21:54.713 --> 00:21:56.772
It's the wind flower.

00:22:03.588 --> 00:22:06.182
Let's go, Rushuna.

00:22:14.299 --> 00:22:23.935
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:34.681
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:35.987 --> 00:22:41.220
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:41.393 --> 00:22:45.454
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:46.531 --> 00:22:54.267
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:54.606 --> 00:22:56.699
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:56.975 --> 00:23:02.106
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:02.314 --> 00:23:07.752
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:07.953 --> 00:23:17.954
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:18.296 --> 00:23:29.104
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:29.274 --> 00:23:39.878
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.988
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:44.623 --> 00:23:47.251
Once we cross the lake,
we'll be in Tento.

00:23:47.392 --> 00:23:50.054
The Juttensen attack us out of nowhere.

00:23:50.595 --> 00:23:54.895
The Jester, no, the former Rebel leader...
what is he after?

00:23:55.267 --> 00:23:58.395
What is going on in Tento?

00:23:58.537 --> 00:24:00.698
One mystery leads to another.

00:24:00.806 --> 00:24:02.467
But first, a bath!

00:24:02.641 --> 00:24:07.101
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
Entering Tento.

00:24:07.279 --> 00:24:09.270
Would you like to join me?

00:24:09.381 --> 00:24:11.975
<i>Entering Tento</i>
